   "ocr": "The table presents poverty indicators and equivalised income statistics from 2008 to 2011. Under the header \"% At risk of poverty,\" the values for 2008 are 12.4% (Survey) and 15.2% (Reg.), for 2009 are 12.0% (Survey) and 14.5% (Reg.), for 2010 are 12.1% (Survey) and 14.7% (Reg.), and for 2011 are 12.6% (Survey) and 14.5% (Reg.)."
