   "ocr": "The \"Poverty threshold, €\" shows values of 11,406 (2008), 11,648 (2009), 11,931 (2010), 12,281 (2011), 12,371 (2010), 12,635 (2011), 12,791 (2010), and 12,878 (2011). In the \"Poverty gap, %,\" the figures are 15.3% (2008), 19.9% (2009), 16.9% (2010), 19.2% (2011), 17.2% (2010), 21.8% (2011), 19% (2010), and 19.1% (2011)."
